  "goodToKnow": "Die Logistik is the planning and movement of goods, from warehouses to delivery: Transport, Lagerung and Lieferketten. The word has nothing to do with Logik, although the military used it first for the supply of armies. Typical compounds: das Logistikzentrum, die Logistikbranche, der Logistiker (the logistics specialist). The adjective is logistisch: ein logistisches Problem."
